WEBVTT

01:47.300 --> 01:51.940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:52.060 --> 01:54.980
[Episode 28]
[This story is purely fictional]

01:56.300 --> 02:01.420
[Huo's Secondary Residence, Changsha Suburb]

02:13.430 --> 02:14.500
Fifth Master,

02:14.910 --> 02:16.380
stop walking back and forth.

02:16.960 --> 02:18.570
It annoys me.

02:20.000 --> 02:21.690
Still no news from the city?

02:22.590 --> 02:23.570
Relax.

02:24.240 --> 02:24.610
Master Zhang

02:24.870 --> 02:26.290
has a plan.

02:28.310 --> 02:28.890
Anyway,

02:29.240 --> 02:30.010
it's almost done.

02:30.360 --> 02:31.180
We can eat soon.

02:31.180 --> 02:31.890
I don't have the appetite.

02:32.520 --> 02:32.980
You can eat.

02:35.000 --> 02:35.980
Where are you going?

02:40.590 --> 02:41.450
Dear Godfather,

02:42.190 --> 02:43.010
the south is in turmoil.

02:43.560 --> 02:45.690
Our southern transportation route was suddenly sealed by the officials.

02:46.560 --> 02:48.500
My companions from the Mystic Nine have been accused of thievery.

02:49.030 --> 02:49.780
Our movement is very much limited,

02:50.000 --> 02:50.730
and we are in great danger.

02:52.030 --> 02:53.540
I seek your assistance to release a statement

02:54.360 --> 02:55.220
clarifying the legal status

02:55.360 --> 02:56.450
of our goods

02:57.190 --> 02:58.130
so that the seal can be lifted.

02:58.840 --> 02:59.690
Your help is much appreciated.

03:02.120 --> 03:02.690
Miss Huo.

03:03.630 --> 03:05.220
Send this telegram to Beiping.

03:05.310 --> 03:06.540
Don't let anyone find out.

03:15.630 --> 03:16.850
Should I congratulate you

03:17.520 --> 03:18.410
on your promotion?

03:19.080 --> 03:20.290
There's nothing to celebrate.

03:22.840 --> 03:23.690
This position

03:24.280 --> 03:25.290
means more duties and restraints.

03:27.630 --> 03:28.170
Thank you.

03:30.520 --> 03:31.100
Have you

03:32.280 --> 03:33.820
paid attention to the goings-on lately?

03:35.800 --> 03:36.850
The situation is tense.

03:38.190 --> 03:40.010
We will go to war with Japan soon.

03:40.840 --> 03:41.570
Therefore,

03:43.120 --> 03:44.410
what Huo Wenhai did was perfectly

03:45.000 --> 03:46.010
understandable.

03:47.120 --> 03:48.660
Before we fight a common enemy, we must ensure there's no in-fighting.

03:51.630 --> 03:53.570
The Mystic Nine is a threat.

04:00.680 --> 04:01.890
This cannot have come from you.

04:03.000 --> 04:03.940
It's unlike you.

04:04.520 --> 04:05.290
Of course it wasn't me.

04:06.590 --> 04:07.170
But

04:08.280 --> 04:10.410
you are supposed to get rid of the Mystic Nine,

04:10.800 --> 04:11.940
yet you still haven't done that.

04:12.800 --> 04:13.690
You put me in a difficult situation.

04:15.680 --> 04:16.220
The current situation

04:17.310 --> 04:18.610
solves both our conundrums.

04:20.310 --> 04:21.100
As I said,

04:22.070 --> 04:23.610
this is going to happen to the Mystic Nine one day.

04:25.310 --> 04:27.050
But the Mystic Nine helped to sabotage

04:28.120 --> 04:29.340
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama's plan.

04:30.480 --> 04:31.700
If the Mystic Nine is eradicated,

04:32.390 --> 04:33.660
other sects in the city

04:34.360 --> 04:35.700
will take up arms and attack

04:36.600 --> 04:37.580
the Ministry of War.

04:38.240 --> 04:39.410
It will jeopardize

04:41.630 --> 04:42.590
future governance.

04:43.070 --> 04:44.220
That's my excuse

04:44.830 --> 04:46.020
to tell Huo Wenhai

04:46.720 --> 04:48.290
to just capture all of you, not kill.

04:49.240 --> 04:50.530
But the higher-up now knows

04:50.560 --> 04:51.540
that the Mystic Nine has been captured.

04:52.160 --> 04:53.340
If the execution order comes through,

04:54.160 --> 04:55.460
I won't be able to stop it.

04:58.120 --> 04:58.580
Luo Ang.

05:00.120 --> 05:01.220
I know you hold onto your principles

05:01.270 --> 05:02.540
more so than I do.

05:03.720 --> 05:04.780
If the Ministry of War makes an order,

05:04.830 --> 05:05.850
you'll see it through.

05:06.680 --> 05:08.100
But we are close friends.

05:10.000 --> 05:11.780
Can you spare the Mystic Nine?

05:18.190 --> 05:19.610
If you had followed my advice

05:21.000 --> 05:22.140
and dealt with the Mystic Nine accordingly,

05:23.070 --> 05:24.850
I would have let this slide.

05:26.480 --> 05:27.930
But Huo Wenhai now wants

05:28.390 --> 05:29.780
the Mystic Nine gone.

05:30.310 --> 05:31.610
And you can't do anything about it.

05:33.160 --> 05:34.730
If you want to spare the Mystic Nine...

05:35.360 --> 05:36.020
Unless

05:36.560 --> 05:38.580
Huo Wenhai commits a violation.

05:39.360 --> 05:41.100
Then, you become the special commissioner

05:41.480 --> 05:42.250
who deals with the Mystic Nine.

05:43.040 --> 05:43.410
That way,

05:44.160 --> 05:45.490
you'll have the chance to find a loophole.

05:48.630 --> 05:49.540
It's a military order.

05:50.830 --> 05:51.490
Whether Huo Wenhai

05:52.430 --> 05:53.730
or I execute it,

05:54.190 --> 05:55.140
what difference does it make?

05:55.750 --> 05:56.370
Zhang Qishan.

05:57.390 --> 05:58.810
If you get rid of the Mystic Nine,

05:59.750 --> 06:00.980
you'll be doing the Ministry of War a favor.

06:01.680 --> 06:03.140
You're siding with it.

06:04.120 --> 06:06.540
Naturally, the ministry will think highly of you.

06:08.600 --> 06:09.410
After all these years,

06:10.430 --> 06:12.050
the higher-up is no longer sure

06:13.480 --> 06:14.700
if you're the Mystic Nine

06:15.480 --> 06:16.700
or the defense commander.

06:18.240 --> 06:19.290
To put it bluntly,

06:19.920 --> 06:20.930
if the Mystic Nine falls,

06:21.390 --> 06:23.410
you have to die as well.

06:24.600 --> 06:25.850
But that's not the outcome I want.

06:26.720 --> 06:28.220
You are an excellent soldier.

06:28.870 --> 06:30.340
You should die on the battlefield.

06:39.430 --> 06:40.580
Xie Jiu has confessed.

06:41.800 --> 06:43.020
He said he was forced

06:43.950 --> 06:45.220
to work with the Japanese.

06:45.830 --> 06:47.050
The one who coerced him

06:49.680 --> 06:51.100
was Changsha Special Commissioner,

06:51.240 --> 06:52.220
Huo Wenhai.

06:55.390 --> 06:56.980
When I submit evidence of their collusion

06:57.680 --> 06:58.930
to the Ministry of War,

07:01.000 --> 07:02.140
you will become

07:02.800 --> 07:03.930
the special commissioner.

07:05.920 --> 07:06.610
Xie Jiu

07:07.430 --> 07:08.900
has already committed suicide in the cell.

07:11.240 --> 07:11.780
What?

07:17.630 --> 07:19.020
[To Master Zhang, From Xie]
He left this letter to you.

07:25.800 --> 07:26.900
Don't let him die in vain.

07:34.420 --> 07:36.500
[To Master Zhang, From Xie]

07:48.950 --> 07:49.490
Master Zhang.

07:50.310 --> 07:51.900
When you're reading this,

07:52.390 --> 07:53.780
I'm probably gone.

07:54.360 --> 07:55.780
Do not avenge me.

07:58.000 --> 07:58.660
Master Zhang.

08:00.600 --> 08:01.730
My fate is sealed.

08:02.160 --> 08:03.290
I die willingly.

08:03.680 --> 08:04.580
Do not worry about me.

08:06.240 --> 08:06.780
Remember.

08:07.630 --> 08:09.780
The time is running out for the Mystic Nine.

08:21.040 --> 08:22.250
You have two options.

08:23.040 --> 08:23.580
One,

08:24.190 --> 08:25.220
defy the military order

08:25.510 --> 08:26.410
and protect the Mystic Nine.

08:28.000 --> 08:28.580
Luo Ang

08:29.360 --> 08:31.100
will reinstate Huo Wenhai.

08:31.750 --> 08:33.530
Huo Wenhai will not show mercy,

08:34.080 --> 08:35.370
and the Mystic Nine will fall.

08:36.200 --> 08:37.130
What about my second option?

08:37.630 --> 08:39.130
Kill six to protect three.

08:39.390 --> 08:39.980
No way.

08:40.120 --> 08:41.420
Don't jump to conclusions.

08:42.000 --> 08:42.650
Listen to me.

08:42.720 --> 08:43.250
You know

08:44.000 --> 08:45.490
I will not do this

08:46.840 --> 08:47.850
just to protect myself.

08:48.360 --> 08:49.250
Zhang Qishan.

08:49.670 --> 08:50.420
Do you

08:50.600 --> 08:51.640
really want to sit and watch how they

08:51.640 --> 08:52.610
get rid of the Mystic Nine?

08:58.080 --> 08:58.770
The Mystic Nine.

08:59.200 --> 09:00.130
Kill six clans

09:00.550 --> 09:01.460
to protect three clans.

09:02.750 --> 09:03.650
The Ministry of War

09:03.790 --> 09:05.700
and I agreed on this.

09:06.600 --> 09:07.610
It's the limit

09:07.670 --> 09:09.180
of their leniency.

09:14.510 --> 09:15.010
Xie Jiu.

09:18.600 --> 09:20.220
I know you have a plan.

09:21.670 --> 09:22.580
Help me again.

09:24.320 --> 09:25.100
Master Zhang.

09:26.750 --> 09:27.980
Our killer isn't

09:28.000 --> 09:28.890
the Ministry of War.

09:30.150 --> 09:32.010
It's the status quo.

09:33.360 --> 09:34.580
You are a smart man.

09:35.360 --> 09:36.890
You know the right decision to make.

09:40.390 --> 09:41.610
Do not be carried away by your emotion.

09:41.870 --> 09:43.010
Without the Mystic Nine,

09:45.510 --> 09:47.300
the world wouldn't be as peaceful now!

09:52.000 --> 09:53.420
I will not let them down.

09:58.630 --> 09:59.770
If I must sacrifice myself

09:59.910 --> 10:00.730
to keep the Mystic Nine safe...

10:00.790 --> 10:01.580
Master Zhang.

10:03.790 --> 10:04.130
Master Zhang.

10:04.630 --> 10:05.490
I'm running out of time.

10:07.630 --> 10:08.610
You already know

10:08.960 --> 10:10.420
which six clans

10:11.000 --> 10:11.820
to eliminate.

10:12.550 --> 10:13.180
Right?

10:31.870 --> 10:33.060
Eryue Hong must be spared.

10:34.790 --> 10:35.980
Huo Xiangu must be spared.

10:37.670 --> 10:38.730
One is a renowned opera actor.

10:39.790 --> 10:41.100
The other has a clan full of women.

10:42.480 --> 10:43.420
If the Ministry of War

10:43.480 --> 10:44.770
kills them,

10:46.320 --> 10:47.650
there'll be a public outrage,

10:48.390 --> 10:49.250
or even a riot.

10:53.240 --> 10:54.530
You are a Japanese sympathizer.

10:57.150 --> 10:58.370
So you're destined to die.

11:01.360 --> 11:02.610
Chen Pi is a thug.

11:04.240 --> 11:05.370
Heibei is a murderer.

11:06.960 --> 11:08.010
Li is a gangster.

11:09.440 --> 11:10.100
Tiezui...

11:10.240 --> 11:11.420
None of them can live.

11:12.270 --> 11:13.700
But you're different, Master Zhang.

11:14.510 --> 11:15.980
You have to fight our invader.

11:16.000 --> 11:16.940
We cannot kill Laogou.

11:17.240 --> 11:18.280
He has saved so many people.

11:18.280 --> 11:19.100
He's also a thug.

11:19.270 --> 11:20.940
Wu Laogou has to die.

11:29.030 --> 11:29.700
Master Zhang.

11:32.200 --> 11:33.420
The Mystic Nine is old.

11:35.270 --> 11:36.180
We can't carry on anymore.

11:37.960 --> 11:38.730
But you

11:39.790 --> 11:41.850
must forge on with those

11:42.510 --> 11:43.370
who live.

11:46.440 --> 11:47.420
Don't look back.

12:27.960 --> 12:28.700
To Ninth Master.

12:56.750 --> 12:57.650
Does he

12:57.670 --> 12:58.700
not have a better plan?

12:59.390 --> 13:00.580
He sacrificed his life to set up everything.

13:03.080 --> 13:04.370
He wouldn't have done this

13:05.870 --> 13:06.730
if there was a better plan.

13:08.080 --> 13:08.700
Perhaps

13:10.510 --> 13:12.220
we can just disband the Mystic Nine?

13:12.790 --> 13:14.460
In Changsha and its neighboring provinces,

13:15.440 --> 13:16.420
there are more than 100,000 people

13:16.440 --> 13:17.300
under the Mystic Nine.

13:18.030 --> 13:18.770
How can we disband it?

13:23.360 --> 13:23.770
Master Zhang.

13:25.910 --> 13:27.730
Do you have a plan?

13:32.030 --> 13:34.220
Threaten Luo Ang to spare the Mystic Nine.

13:35.870 --> 13:37.220
After the Mystic Nine leave Changsha,

13:37.480 --> 13:38.460
I'll convince Luo Ang

13:39.320 --> 13:40.370
not to drag all of you into this.

13:42.120 --> 13:43.060
Then, I'll head to Nanjing

13:44.000 --> 13:44.770
to receive my punishment.

13:45.790 --> 13:46.970
That means you'll be going against

13:46.970 --> 13:48.420
the Ministry of War.

13:49.440 --> 13:51.130
You will be suspended, or even executed.

13:52.150 --> 13:53.370
Ninth Master will die in vain.

13:53.870 --> 13:54.370
That's good.

13:55.840 --> 13:56.940
I can see him

13:57.390 --> 13:58.250
and apologize to him.

13:58.910 --> 13:59.420
Master Zhang.

14:02.000 --> 14:03.530
I can do all this for you.

14:05.000 --> 14:05.940
Then, you'll just say

14:06.910 --> 14:08.010
I've gone rogue

14:08.270 --> 14:09.220
and have me executed.

14:10.150 --> 14:11.250
To put everything to an end,

14:13.200 --> 14:14.220
I have to die.

14:15.200 --> 14:15.730
My death

14:17.080 --> 14:18.340
will convince the Ministry of War

14:18.910 --> 14:20.370
that the Mystic Nine will not rise again.

14:20.910 --> 14:21.650
I won't let this happen.

14:55.320 --> 14:56.130
Remember

14:58.000 --> 14:59.100
when we first met?

15:00.270 --> 15:00.940
I asked

15:01.750 --> 15:04.340
what you would do when all hope seemed lost.

15:10.700 --> 15:13.660
[Ancient Zhang's Residence, Northeastern China]

15:23.030 --> 15:24.460
Traitors

15:25.510 --> 15:26.730
don't deserve a face.

15:26.730 --> 15:27.780
[Traitor]

15:48.360 --> 15:49.340
Outsider.

15:50.670 --> 15:52.180
I have spared you.

15:53.000 --> 15:54.460
You shouldn't be here.

16:02.790 --> 16:03.580
Do you want to live?

16:06.790 --> 16:07.820
You can try

16:09.030 --> 16:10.180
escaping once more.

16:21.790 --> 16:22.610
Do you want to live?

16:24.670 --> 16:25.770
If you want to live,

16:28.600 --> 16:30.060
I'll save you.

16:40.000 --> 16:41.300
Do you want to live or not?

16:46.120 --> 16:47.340
I want to live.

16:50.030 --> 16:51.130
I'll come with you.

16:57.080 --> 16:58.060
Will they catch up to us?

16:58.600 --> 16:59.610
If they do,

17:00.000 --> 17:00.770
we're done for.

17:01.670 --> 17:02.300
Don't worry.

17:03.000 --> 17:04.810
The Zhang Clan is a mess now.

17:05.350 --> 17:06.900
Their internal issues will keep them occupied.

17:07.310 --> 17:07.980
They don't have time

17:08.070 --> 17:09.140
for outsiders like us.

17:12.680 --> 17:13.770
Why did you save me?

17:14.640 --> 17:16.420
You are from the Zhang Clan's principal family.

17:17.110 --> 17:17.700
Why

17:18.750 --> 17:19.900
did you run away?

17:22.310 --> 17:22.730
Because...

17:26.480 --> 17:27.570
Because I couldn't stand my clan

17:27.590 --> 17:28.420
anymore.

17:29.590 --> 17:30.730
I wanted freedom.

17:37.200 --> 17:38.490
That's why I saved you.

17:39.220 --> 17:43.500
♪The prophecy once foretold♪

17:43.750 --> 17:44.770
Thank you for saving me.

17:45.200 --> 17:45.700
Get up.

17:47.180 --> 17:50.820
♪Ask those who've joined♪

17:52.400 --> 17:53.420
If you trust me,

17:54.720 --> 17:55.730
you can follow me.

17:56.720 --> 17:57.140
Perhaps

17:58.110 --> 17:59.730
we'll find a new path for us.

17:59.960 --> 18:00.660
I'll come with you.

18:01.860 --> 18:04.540
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

18:05.200 --> 18:06.050
What is your name?

18:08.030 --> 18:08.490
I'm...

18:10.680 --> 18:11.220
Xiaoyu.

18:12.960 --> 18:14.180
You'll be Xiaoyu from now on.

18:16.110 --> 18:17.090
Zhang Xiaoyu.

18:17.920 --> 18:18.730
A fish is free.

18:19.830 --> 18:20.700
You are free.

18:23.750 --> 18:24.250
Master Zhang.

18:26.340 --> 18:27.010
I am a traitor

18:27.030 --> 18:28.710
expelled by my clan.

18:31.590 --> 18:32.730
Why did you save me?

18:37.200 --> 18:38.530
Because you said you wanted to live.

18:40.110 --> 18:40.900
I'm not one

18:42.310 --> 18:43.220
to look at one's past.

18:45.110 --> 18:45.940
I only see the future.

18:46.220 --> 18:49.980
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

18:49.980 --> 18:52.540
♪Take care♪

18:52.550 --> 18:53.530
Take good care of others.

18:57.590 --> 18:58.010
Master Zhang.

19:12.140 --> 19:15.860
♪The past fades like smoke♪

19:16.700 --> 19:18.420
♪A choice is made in silence♪

19:19.460 --> 19:22.140
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

19:23.140 --> 19:26.620
♪Who is lucky enough to reach the shore?♪

19:26.900 --> 19:29.580
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

19:29.590 --> 19:30.050
Master Zhang.

19:32.640 --> 19:33.290
Forgive me.

19:34.220 --> 19:35.460
♪But this could♪

19:36.200 --> 19:37.660
I am a traitor through and through.

19:40.900 --> 19:41.580
[To Zhang Xiaoyu]

19:41.580 --> 19:44.860
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

19:45.300 --> 19:48.700
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

19:49.640 --> 19:51.290
Dear Adjutant Xiaoyu,

19:52.070 --> 19:53.220
the survival of the Mystic Nine

19:53.310 --> 19:54.700
is upon us.

19:55.350 --> 19:57.140
I have a way to keep the Mystic Nine alive.

19:57.590 --> 19:58.700
We kill six clans to save three clans.

19:59.510 --> 20:01.250
But Master Zhang will not comply.

20:01.920 --> 20:03.490
And he will die for it.

20:04.590 --> 20:06.010
If you want to save Master Zhang,

20:06.640 --> 20:08.220
you need to do three things for me.

20:09.000 --> 20:09.530
One,

20:10.400 --> 20:12.570
immobilize Master Zhang for at least one day.

20:13.310 --> 20:15.860
Two, you must kill Huo Wenhai.

20:16.640 --> 20:18.050
Huo Wenhai has a private army.

20:18.550 --> 20:19.770
Something's afoot.

20:20.110 --> 20:22.090
If you don't kill him, he will change everything.

20:22.640 --> 20:24.980
Three, do not break into the prison

20:25.030 --> 20:25.940
to save the Mystic Nine.

20:26.440 --> 20:27.860
I have another plan for that.

20:28.260 --> 20:30.020
♪We too were young once♪

20:30.020 --> 20:31.940
♪Fortunate to brave♪

20:31.940 --> 20:33.860
♪The raging waves together♪

20:33.860 --> 20:36.060
♪Keep the ember lit♪

20:36.060 --> 20:40.460
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

20:40.660 --> 20:43.980
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

20:44.340 --> 20:47.740
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

20:48.060 --> 20:51.780
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

20:51.980 --> 20:55.220
♪Who believes in fate?♪

20:55.420 --> 20:58.700
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

20:59.180 --> 21:02.620
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

21:02.860 --> 21:06.620
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

21:06.620 --> 21:11.340
♪Please♪

21:12.500 --> 21:17.060
♪Do take care of yourself♪

21:25.240 --> 21:25.620
Sir.

21:26.960 --> 21:28.330
Have we found Wu Laogou and the rest?

21:29.310 --> 21:30.330
No updates so far.

21:31.440 --> 21:32.050
But Sir,

21:32.480 --> 21:33.900
Zhang Xiaoyu is here. He wishes to see you.

21:35.000 --> 21:36.420
He drugged Zhang Qishan

21:36.720 --> 21:38.980
and wants to negotiate with you.

21:41.680 --> 21:42.570
Zhang Xiaoyu?

21:45.510 --> 21:46.460
Zhang Qishan

21:46.590 --> 21:48.050
is getting impatient.

21:48.680 --> 21:49.960
He's using such a cheap

21:49.960 --> 21:50.770
trick.

21:51.640 --> 21:52.660
Does he want to kill me that badly?

21:56.200 --> 21:57.490
Zhang Xiaoyu is betraying him?

21:58.590 --> 21:59.570
Does he even believe it himself?

22:00.110 --> 22:01.380
I shall turn him down then.

22:01.830 --> 22:02.220
No.

22:04.790 --> 22:05.420
Let him in.

22:06.550 --> 22:07.250
I want to see

22:08.070 --> 22:09.700
what trick he has.

22:11.240 --> 22:12.530
Bring the men from Xiangxi too.

22:13.200 --> 22:14.660
I'll make sure he won't get out alive.

22:14.760 --> 22:15.250
Yes.

22:20.180 --> 22:21.660
[Changsha Defense Headquarters]

22:27.110 --> 22:28.290
You even brought

22:28.350 --> 22:29.980
Zhang Qishan's military seal.

22:30.310 --> 22:31.220
You sure

22:31.240 --> 22:32.180
have gone out of your way.

22:33.160 --> 22:34.010
I stole it.

22:34.590 --> 22:36.380
How loyal of you.

22:37.270 --> 22:38.380
Commander Huo,

22:38.790 --> 22:40.050
can we talk now?

22:40.720 --> 22:41.770
After all, it concerns

22:42.110 --> 22:43.900
your life.

22:45.550 --> 22:46.380
Tell me.

22:47.680 --> 22:49.460
You'd better be telling the truth.

22:50.030 --> 22:50.980
Do you know

22:51.960 --> 22:53.250
what Officer Luo and Master Zhang

22:54.200 --> 22:55.770
talked about?

22:59.000 --> 22:59.570
Tell me.

22:59.720 --> 23:01.050
He didn't return to Changsha

23:02.000 --> 23:03.180
for official business.

23:04.000 --> 23:05.180
He came back to rescue someone.

23:05.960 --> 23:07.530
He did it to rescue Master Zhang

23:08.000 --> 23:09.860
so that Master Zhang can continue working for the Ministry of War.

23:10.480 --> 23:12.860
He wants Master Zhang to eliminate the Mystic Nine

23:13.350 --> 23:15.180
personally as proof of allegiance.

23:15.590 --> 23:16.290
That way,

23:17.550 --> 23:19.050
the Ministry of War no longer has a thorn in their side.

23:20.110 --> 23:20.860
But it's at the cost

23:23.790 --> 23:24.460
of your life.

23:29.000 --> 23:30.330
Xie Jiu committed suicide by drinking poison.

23:31.550 --> 23:32.810
Before he died, he left a letter

23:33.640 --> 23:37.220
saying that he and you worked for the Japanese.

23:38.350 --> 23:39.730
After you surrender your position,

23:40.550 --> 23:42.180
Master Zhang can take over

23:42.400 --> 23:44.220
as the new special commissioner, replacing you.

23:45.160 --> 23:46.980
He'll have the power to eliminate the Mystic Nine.

23:53.830 --> 23:55.090
You're trying to drive a wedge between us.

23:56.550 --> 23:57.330
Do you think

23:57.350 --> 23:58.180
I'll take your word

23:58.200 --> 23:59.290
at face value?

23:59.790 --> 24:00.730
You know very well

24:02.000 --> 24:03.090
if I'm telling the truth or not.

24:04.400 --> 24:05.660
If what you're saying is true,

24:06.590 --> 24:07.380
isn't that

24:07.400 --> 24:08.420
what you want as well?

24:09.160 --> 24:10.250
Why did you

24:10.310 --> 24:11.180
come here today?

24:11.830 --> 24:12.730
People like us

24:14.030 --> 24:14.940
followed him back then

24:15.960 --> 24:17.660
and fought our way out of Northeastern China.

24:18.550 --> 24:19.700
Every time, we put our necks

24:19.750 --> 24:21.420
on the line for him.

24:22.400 --> 24:23.090
In the end,

24:24.030 --> 24:25.180
he decides to sacrifice

24:25.830 --> 24:26.380
all of us

24:26.400 --> 24:27.530
to save the Mystic Nine.

24:29.680 --> 24:30.700
Then shouldn't you

24:30.720 --> 24:31.900
kill Zhang Qishan right away?

24:32.160 --> 24:33.330
Master Zhang saved me.

24:33.440 --> 24:34.700
I will not harm him.

24:35.720 --> 24:37.140
But Wu Laogou,

24:37.510 --> 24:38.900
Huo Xiangu, and Qi Tiezui

24:39.000 --> 24:40.050
are all missing.

24:40.880 --> 24:42.050
I know where they are.

24:56.960 --> 24:57.940
Before Master Zhang returned,

24:58.070 --> 24:59.180
he gave them a place to stay.

25:00.750 --> 25:01.570
Right now,

25:03.310 --> 25:04.700
they are in an old military site

25:04.790 --> 25:05.810
at the northwestern part of the city.

25:26.540 --> 25:28.260
[Traitor]

27:47.920 --> 27:48.530
Master Zhang.

27:50.200 --> 27:51.700
I will never

27:53.200 --> 27:54.180
betray you again.

28:05.180 --> 28:13.220
[Xuanzhen Temple]

28:18.660 --> 28:20.460
[Xuanzhen Temple]

28:23.140 --> 28:25.900
[Xuanzhen Temple]

28:37.720 --> 28:38.220
Sir,

28:39.270 --> 28:40.530
is there a letter for me

28:41.000 --> 28:41.810
here?

28:54.160 --> 28:57.010
The man who left this letter

28:57.270 --> 28:58.330
said you were illiterate.

28:58.680 --> 29:01.490
So I shall read it to you.

29:02.240 --> 29:02.730
Thank you.

29:06.880 --> 29:09.460
Fifth Master, I hope this letter finds you well.

29:10.270 --> 29:13.050
When you're reading this,

29:13.750 --> 29:17.330
I'm probably already dead.

29:18.640 --> 29:23.140
The Mystic Nine is destined to fall.

29:36.720 --> 29:37.330
Ninth Master.

29:38.590 --> 29:39.420
Laogou.

29:41.110 --> 29:42.770
It is inescapable that the Ministry of War

29:43.880 --> 29:45.090
will eliminate the Mystic Nine.

29:47.480 --> 29:48.450
Master Zhang

29:48.450 --> 29:49.730
will use his life

29:50.000 --> 29:51.620
to threaten the Ministry of War

29:53.030 --> 29:55.530
to spare us.

29:56.590 --> 29:57.050
But that

29:59.160 --> 30:01.380
is merely prolonging the inevitable.

30:05.070 --> 30:06.570
The Mystic Nine will not let Master Zhang die.

30:07.480 --> 30:08.620
The war needs him.

30:10.440 --> 30:11.330
Therefore,

30:12.400 --> 30:13.940
when they execute Master Zhang,

30:15.160 --> 30:16.180
to save him,

30:17.110 --> 30:18.290
the Mystic Nine will return

30:18.880 --> 30:20.660
to break him out.

30:22.030 --> 30:22.770
When that happens,

30:24.830 --> 30:26.770
all of us will die.

30:30.030 --> 30:31.460
Look no further than the story of Water Margin

30:33.240 --> 30:35.250
to know what happened to those who tried to break the prisoner out.

30:35.830 --> 30:36.460
We

30:38.070 --> 30:40.050
should be the heroes in the story.

30:40.790 --> 30:41.380
Tell me.

30:42.510 --> 30:43.490
What is your plan?

30:45.400 --> 30:47.420
You hold the key

30:50.790 --> 30:52.330
to our plan.

30:54.590 --> 30:55.460
You're overestimating me.

30:56.510 --> 30:57.460
I raise dogs. That's all.

30:58.110 --> 30:58.900
Fifth Master,

31:00.880 --> 31:02.900
you're so much better than you think.

31:04.240 --> 31:07.770
Everyone worships Master Zhang like a deity.

31:08.680 --> 31:10.460
But a deity is not a mortal.

31:11.680 --> 31:13.530
He doesn't know how to love like a mortal does.

31:14.510 --> 31:15.940
But Fifth Master, you are a mortal.

31:16.960 --> 31:18.050
That's why

31:19.880 --> 31:21.620
only you can save the people.

31:21.960 --> 31:23.620
Only you can save the deity.

31:24.070 --> 31:24.770
I can't.

31:26.350 --> 31:27.490
I kill the deity.

31:29.030 --> 31:29.570
Exactly.

31:31.550 --> 31:32.660
That is precisely the reason.

31:33.880 --> 31:35.140
Among the Mystic Nine,

31:36.790 --> 31:38.810
you're the one who despises our ways the most,

31:39.440 --> 31:41.420
the one who can't stand the Mystic Nine.

31:43.270 --> 31:45.380
Everyone in Changsha City knows that.

31:47.830 --> 31:48.860
Therefore,

31:49.880 --> 31:51.010
you have to become

31:51.070 --> 31:53.250
the head of the Mystic Nine.

31:53.830 --> 31:55.700
That way, the Ministry of War

31:56.680 --> 31:57.330
will think

31:58.350 --> 32:00.420
that when they kill you,

32:01.270 --> 32:02.530
the other clans

32:03.510 --> 32:05.460
will not return to save you.

32:07.200 --> 32:08.980
Then, most people in the Mystic Nine

32:11.920 --> 32:13.730
will be safe.

32:16.270 --> 32:17.730
Only you

32:19.550 --> 32:21.810
can save us from this predicament.

32:23.110 --> 32:24.250
You want me to sacrifice myself

32:25.070 --> 32:26.140
for the Mystic Nine?

32:28.830 --> 32:29.770
Why should I do that?

32:35.680 --> 32:37.050
If you do not help us,

32:37.960 --> 32:40.050
the Mystic Nine will lose the protection afforded by Master Zhang.

32:40.640 --> 32:42.290
Thousands of our members

32:42.640 --> 32:44.330
will be executed by the Ministry of War.

32:45.000 --> 32:47.180
The women and the vulnerable will be expelled from Changsha,

32:47.350 --> 32:48.570
left to their own devices.

32:49.440 --> 32:50.090
I believe

32:51.440 --> 32:52.900
you don't want

32:53.640 --> 32:55.380
to see that happen.

32:57.070 --> 32:58.180
You're threatening me now.

32:58.720 --> 33:00.090
It's the reality.

33:01.640 --> 33:02.380
Of course,

33:04.510 --> 33:06.290
you can choose to ignore all this.

33:18.110 --> 33:19.010
Even if I agree to this,

33:19.640 --> 33:20.730
according to the rules in the Mystic Nine,

33:21.470 --> 33:22.950
I have to kill the previous master

33:23.310 --> 33:24.330
to take over their position.

33:24.550 --> 33:25.530
Do you want me to kill every master

33:25.550 --> 33:26.250
in the Mystic Nine?

33:26.750 --> 33:27.570
No need to kill.

33:29.070 --> 33:30.090
Just render them useless.

33:31.590 --> 33:32.420
But

33:33.200 --> 33:34.980
the Ministry of War has already infiltrated the Mystic Nine.

33:35.920 --> 33:37.010
Each clan

33:37.310 --> 33:39.570
has spies from the Ministry of War.

33:40.640 --> 33:41.330
Hence,

33:43.160 --> 33:45.220
you must hit where it hurts the most

33:45.790 --> 33:47.420
so that the Ministry of War will believe

33:47.920 --> 33:49.330
that they no longer

33:49.400 --> 33:50.700
pose a threat.

33:53.000 --> 33:54.010
Like how?

33:57.000 --> 33:57.700
For example,

33:59.110 --> 34:01.010
turn Eryue Hong into a cripple

34:03.830 --> 34:04.810
so that

34:04.880 --> 34:06.180
he can no longer perform.

34:06.240 --> 34:07.290
Xie Jiu, you're insane!

34:07.790 --> 34:09.210
That's no different from killing him.

34:09.510 --> 34:11.010
The Ministry of War won't believe you

34:11.070 --> 34:12.900
unless you go that far.

34:13.880 --> 34:14.610
When that happens,

34:15.920 --> 34:18.300
no one in the Mystic Nine can live.

34:19.760 --> 34:20.530
Fifth Master.

34:22.400 --> 34:24.530
Sacrifice a few lives

34:25.710 --> 34:26.570
or

34:26.630 --> 34:28.820
the thousands of lives in the Mystic Nine?

34:31.070 --> 34:31.940
The masters of Mystic Nine

34:33.400 --> 34:34.530
saved my life

34:35.880 --> 34:37.010
in Xinyue Restaurant.

34:40.230 --> 34:41.300
Is this how I repay

34:42.190 --> 34:43.380
their kindness?

34:44.880 --> 34:48.210
Saving our lives is simple.

34:49.230 --> 34:50.460
I have plenty of ways.

34:51.070 --> 34:51.980
What's difficult

34:54.280 --> 34:57.010
is saving thousands of lives.

34:58.030 --> 34:59.900
Save a thousand lives

35:00.070 --> 35:01.530
or save nine lives.

35:01.880 --> 35:03.570
You decide.

35:10.480 --> 35:11.260
You know

35:11.320 --> 35:12.260
what kind of person I am.

35:14.320 --> 35:15.460
That's why you're asking for my help.

35:31.920 --> 35:33.820
The Mystic Nine is on its last breath.

35:34.760 --> 35:36.260
It is an emergency.

35:37.280 --> 35:38.860
Hesitation will lead to irreversible changes.

35:41.590 --> 35:42.210
Fifth Master.

35:43.360 --> 35:44.090
I

35:45.840 --> 35:47.780
count on you for the survival of the Mystic Nine.

36:01.800 --> 36:02.740
That's so unfair.

36:05.480 --> 36:06.490
That's so unfair.

36:08.400 --> 36:10.300
Did God let me join the Mystic Nine

36:12.840 --> 36:13.610
so that

36:13.710 --> 36:15.170
I can die for them instead?

36:35.030 --> 36:35.460
Sir.

36:35.880 --> 36:37.260
There's an uproar.

36:37.800 --> 36:39.270
All news outlets are reporting

36:39.270 --> 36:41.010
about Changsha's curfew and their manhunt for cultists.

36:42.230 --> 36:43.570
But the evidence shows

36:43.800 --> 36:45.900
that there is no cultist at all.

36:46.440 --> 36:48.130
[Curfew]
They say the Ministry of War

36:48.230 --> 36:49.130
framed the righteous people.

36:49.550 --> 36:50.690
The rumor is spreading like wildfire.

36:51.920 --> 36:53.490
The city was locked down for two days

36:54.550 --> 36:55.550
and the news has traveled

36:55.550 --> 36:56.530
to Nanjing and Shanghai.

37:02.670 --> 37:05.780
Someone is expediting the process.

37:07.400 --> 37:07.940
Sir,

37:08.440 --> 37:09.090
if this carries on,

37:09.360 --> 37:10.300
the higher-up will do more

37:10.320 --> 37:11.170
than just questioning us.

37:11.710 --> 37:12.820
We must lift the curfew

37:13.150 --> 37:14.260
and release the masters

37:14.320 --> 37:15.170
of Mystic Nine.

37:17.800 --> 37:18.260
Sure.

37:19.400 --> 37:20.820
It's time to let them go.

37:21.360 --> 37:21.650
Yes.

37:30.260 --> 37:32.340
[Notice]

37:44.110 --> 37:45.050
No more curfew in Changsha.

37:48.550 --> 37:49.460
The masters of Mystic Nine

37:49.760 --> 37:50.780
have been released.

37:50.820 --> 37:51.510
[It is done.]

37:51.510 --> 37:52.570
[Your trouble is gone for now.]
We can finally go back.

37:52.570 --> 37:53.260
[Take care.]

37:54.960 --> 37:55.610
Great.

37:57.630 --> 37:58.260
Where's Wu Laogou?

37:58.800 --> 37:59.340
Laogou is...

38:01.710 --> 38:02.340
Laogou!

38:04.260 --> 38:23.020
[Pear Garden]

38:25.380 --> 38:26.860
[Closed]

38:29.180 --> 38:31.420
[Pear Garden]

38:38.500 --> 38:49.540
[Pear Garden]

39:32.150 --> 39:32.690
Laogou.

39:33.710 --> 39:34.780
Didn't you leave Changsha

39:35.030 --> 39:36.530
with Master Zhang already?

39:38.150 --> 39:38.650
Where is Master Zhang?

40:00.710 --> 40:02.490
The Ministry of War wants the Mystic Nine gone.

40:03.400 --> 40:04.380
They spared us this time,

40:04.800 --> 40:05.650
but it won't last long.

40:06.670 --> 40:07.420
Next time,

40:09.400 --> 40:10.610
they'll kill us.

40:14.320 --> 40:14.780
Laogou.

40:15.590 --> 40:16.300
Leave Changsha

40:17.630 --> 40:18.900
when you still have the chance.

40:21.000 --> 40:22.460
I will take my wife with me

40:24.070 --> 40:25.260
to the west.

41:07.280 --> 41:07.780
What about you?

41:09.480 --> 41:10.210
What's your plan?

41:11.800 --> 41:12.420
I

41:15.070 --> 41:16.170
joined the Mystic Nine.

41:17.760 --> 41:19.610
I finally became one of the top brass.

41:20.880 --> 41:21.940
I'm not going to leave.

41:28.590 --> 41:29.170
Second Master,

41:29.920 --> 41:31.170
I haven't thanked you properly yet.

41:32.590 --> 41:34.010
When I first joined the Mystic Nine,

41:35.070 --> 41:36.170
I thought you'd look down on a dog breeder

41:36.230 --> 41:37.010
like me.

41:37.920 --> 41:39.570
To my surprise, you brought me business,

41:40.110 --> 41:41.820
thus allowing me to find my footing in Changsha.

41:44.230 --> 41:45.300
I'll always remember

41:46.670 --> 41:47.690
this favor from you.

41:49.840 --> 41:50.460
A toast

41:52.110 --> 41:52.860
to you.

41:56.670 --> 41:57.690
It's all in the past.

42:13.710 --> 42:16.340
But I need to mention something from the past.

42:17.150 --> 42:17.690
After all,

42:19.110 --> 42:20.420
I joined the Mystic Nine

42:21.710 --> 42:22.780
because of you.

42:26.320 --> 42:27.740
Perhaps you do not know.

42:30.000 --> 42:30.740
Back then,

42:31.440 --> 42:33.050
I was down there, below the stage.

42:35.710 --> 42:37.010
I watched your troupe

42:37.670 --> 42:38.530
perform

42:39.920 --> 42:41.530
a popular opera

42:41.760 --> 42:44.210
called Havoc in Heaven.

42:48.070 --> 42:48.420
Moreover,

42:49.630 --> 42:50.780
in Xiangyuan Mine,

42:51.400 --> 42:53.170
many laborers were exploited.

42:54.070 --> 42:56.390
I begged the masters of the Mystic Nine

42:56.390 --> 42:57.980
to save the people.

42:58.670 --> 42:59.530
I even

42:59.550 --> 43:01.460
visited your residence.

43:02.190 --> 43:03.010
Do you know

43:03.070 --> 43:04.130
what your man said?

43:10.510 --> 43:12.260
The Second Master of the Mystic Nine

43:12.670 --> 43:15.130
is not someone a nobody could see.

43:21.510 --> 43:21.940
Yes.

43:24.590 --> 43:26.210
I was a nobody back then.

43:27.590 --> 43:28.860
I didn't have the right

43:28.880 --> 43:29.420
to see you.

43:29.960 --> 43:30.650
Who was I

43:30.880 --> 43:32.690
to defend the common folks?

43:36.030 --> 43:37.260
I wasn't aware

43:38.710 --> 43:39.780
of this.

43:43.440 --> 43:44.010
When did that happen?

43:47.070 --> 43:48.010
It

43:48.070 --> 43:49.380
will never reach your ears anyway.

43:51.710 --> 43:52.940
This door of yours

43:53.920 --> 43:54.820
separates two worlds.

43:55.920 --> 43:57.490
How much mortal suffering will you see

43:58.320 --> 44:00.170
sitting behind this door?

44:02.920 --> 44:03.380
So

44:05.400 --> 44:06.780
I understand why the Monkey King

44:06.780 --> 44:08.260
wreaked havoc in heaven.

44:09.590 --> 44:10.740
I also understand that only by

44:11.510 --> 44:13.570
joining the top brass

44:14.320 --> 44:16.690
can I achieve what an ordinary person cannot.

44:27.800 --> 44:28.530
Laogou.

44:31.760 --> 44:32.530
What

44:34.280 --> 44:35.090
are you getting at?

44:35.400 --> 44:36.650
Listen.

44:37.630 --> 44:39.050
After I joined the Mystic Nine,

44:41.880 --> 44:44.010
I found out that top brass like you

44:44.480 --> 44:45.780
did not put your talent to good use.

44:46.320 --> 44:47.690
You fight among each other,

44:47.960 --> 44:49.460
and do nothing if something bad happens.

44:49.550 --> 44:50.380
Do you care

44:50.400 --> 44:51.490
about the ordinary folks?

44:51.710 --> 44:52.650
Have you thought

44:52.880 --> 44:54.740
about delivering them from their misery?

44:59.800 --> 45:00.460
I don't think so.

45:03.760 --> 45:04.820
None of you ever did.

45:12.670 --> 45:16.380
It begins here, so it shall end here.

45:17.150 --> 45:18.340
I returned here

45:19.320 --> 45:20.980
to wreak havoc in heaven.

45:22.070 --> 45:22.820
I will

45:22.840 --> 45:24.890
eliminate you so-called deities

45:24.890 --> 45:26.300
one by one.

45:26.440 --> 45:27.210
The first one

45:27.840 --> 45:29.980
is you, Eryue Hong.

45:52.150 --> 45:52.820
Don't move.

45:54.320 --> 45:55.570
Or you'll die even quicker.

46:00.670 --> 46:02.300
The poison is still in your body, isn't it?

46:04.590 --> 46:05.570
The liquor is not poisoned.

46:07.190 --> 46:08.050
I merely added

46:08.110 --> 46:09.460
something that boosts your blood circulation

46:10.920 --> 46:12.130
so that it activates

46:12.440 --> 46:13.780
the toxin in your body.

46:34.480 --> 46:35.260
Laogou.

46:37.630 --> 46:38.980
What are you trying to do?

46:50.880 --> 46:51.650
Laogou!

46:52.800 --> 46:53.650
You've gone insane!

46:53.960 --> 46:54.860
Humans

46:56.110 --> 46:57.940
cannot escape love, it seems.

46:59.480 --> 47:01.010
You are the Second Master of the Mystic Nine.

47:01.920 --> 47:03.130
How could you let yourself be imprisoned

47:03.230 --> 47:04.300
by your feelings?

47:05.960 --> 47:07.900
You let yourself turn rusty,

47:08.960 --> 47:10.820
giving the Ministry of War a chance to infiltrate us.

47:14.280 --> 47:15.170
You

47:16.070 --> 47:17.570
brought this upon yourself.

47:20.480 --> 47:21.980
No!

47:22.440 --> 47:25.170
No!

47:26.190 --> 47:28.980
No!

47:30.760 --> 47:31.340
No...

47:34.000 --> 47:35.210
No!

47:36.110 --> 47:39.130
No!

47:40.110 --> 47:40.900
No!

47:41.280 --> 47:42.900
Put it down.

47:44.280 --> 47:45.130
No.

47:45.510 --> 47:48.210
No!

48:04.940 --> 48:09.100
♪The past fades like smoke♪

48:09.460 --> 48:12.180
♪A choice is made in silence♪

48:12.460 --> 48:15.260
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

48:15.660 --> 48:19.420
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

48:19.660 --> 48:23.100
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

48:23.380 --> 48:26.780
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

